      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my head is killing me like a massive migraine from hell and i really need something to take it down quick. just a heads up i've been having this really annoying gnawing pain in my stomach for a few weeks now and some bad heartburn too, but i just need help with the headache right now. what's the best thing to take for it?",
