      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear you're feeling unwell. For immediate relief, a mix of ibuprofen or acetaminophen can help alleviate headache pain. However, because you also mentioned stomach issues and heartburn, it's crucial to avoid NSAIDs like ibuprofen if they worsen these problems. Acetaminophen is gentler on the stomach but still provide some relief. Consult your doctor to make sure this approach fits your health profile, especially given the chronic nature of your symptoms.",
