      "content": "i get that but the 400mg thing is like nothing for a migraine this bad. i've seen people online say you can take like 1200mg at once if it's really bad. since i'm an adult and it's an emergency for me, is it really that risky to just take a big dose once to knock it out? i don't want to go to the doctor right now, i just want the pain to stop.",
